# 🛡️ Ethical Hacking Simulation Framework for Cybersecurity Education Using Generative AI

An AI-powered cybersecurity education platform that helps students learn ethical hacking through interactive simulations, AI guidance, and network security tools.

---

## 📖 Project Overview

The Ethical Hacking Simulation Framework is designed to provide hands-on cybersecurity learning using Artificial Intelligence. The platform integrates Google Gemini with popular cybersecurity tools like Nmap and Wireshark, allowing users to generate attack scenarios, receive AI mentoring, analyze networks, and learn ethical hacking concepts in an interactive environment.

---

## ✨ Features

- 🤖 AI Mentor for cybersecurity guidance
- 🎯 AI-powered Scenario Generator
- 🌐 Network Scanning using Nmap
- 📡 Packet Analysis using Wireshark
- 📊 Interactive Dashboard
- 📈 Scan Reports and Learning Progress
- 🎓 Beginner-friendly cybersecurity learning platform

---

