## 🚀 Installation

### Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Devika246617/Ethical-Hacking-Simulation-Framework.git
```

### Move into the project directory

```bash
cd Ethical-Hacking-Simulation-Framework
```

### Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Run the application

```bash
streamlit run dashboard.py
```

